  "character_tex": "The $\\mathcal{N}=1$ characters $\\chi^{NS}_{r,s} = q^{-c/24}\\prod_{n\\ge1}\\frac{1+q^{n-1/2}}{1-q^n}\\sum_{k}\\left(q^{a_k}-q^{b_k}\\right)$ and $\\chi^{R}_{r,s} = q^{1/16-c/24}\\prod_{n\\ge1}\\frac{1+q^{n}}{1-q^n}\\sum_{k}\\left(q^{a_k}-q^{b_k}\\right)$, $a_k = \\frac{(2pp'k+p'r-ps)^2-4}{8pp'}$, $b_k = \\frac{(2pp'k+p'r+ps)^2-4}{8pp'}$, $(p,p') = (18,20)$. With $r = l+1$, $s = l'+1$: $b^{(l,0,l')}$ and $b^{(l,2,l')}$ are the parts of $\\chi^{NS}_{r,s}$ at integer and half-integer level (whichever matches the coset weight), and $b^{(l,1,l')} = \\chi^R_{r,s}$.",
